---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy is part of safety.</h1>
      <p class="lede">AfterFaith Guide is designed to avoid accounts, comments, newsletters, payments, ads, and unnecessary tracking.</p>
      <h2>Resource suggestions</h2>
      <p>The suggest-a-resource form asks for a title, URL, resource type, optional email, and notes. Email is optional and should only be used if clarification is needed.</p>
      <h2>Spam protection</h2>
      <p>The suggestion form may use a privacy-conscious spam check to protect the site from automated submissions.</p>
      <h2>Public content</h2>
      <p>Suggested resources are not public comments or story submissions. Suggestions are stored privately for review.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
